    "notes": "The April 1978 exterior of the National Arts Theatre in Iganmu, Lagos. Includes the four radial gallery sectors, ramped entrances, glazed roof-terrace rings and distinctive saddle shell over the main auditorium. The modern station, campus additions, interiors and surrounding grounds are outside the model. Modern mapped corners control the surviving main geometry. Roof shape and historical finishes are estimated from written architecture evidence."
